    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030680/extras/dd71ac206cf7e0763604fcb7d3ae4c97.avif?t=1743466244\" width=594 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve decided to start a new life in the charming town of Sierra. With your suitcase and your phone, you embark on this exciting adventure. Be who you want to be, meet unique personalities, explore, and create deep connections with the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030680/extras/2d40c8582a30b00c38e8689d62128699.avif?t=1743466244\" width=616 height=342 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, gather, decorate, socialize, relax, and uncover mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030680/extras/6184db8af8f6cc3b2ca749ac30dbb418.avif?t=1743466244\" width=594 height=69 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge Your Destiny:</strong><br>Explore a world full of wonders and secrets waiting to be discovered. Choose how to earn your living: focus on farming, work at the local bakery, or find another way. Build your life with whomever you choose, at your own pace and on your own terms. The control is in your hands!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030680/extras/fe9c82764b161490455b638e76134f75.poster.avif?t=1743466244\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030680/extras/fe9c82764b161490455b638e76134f75.webm?t=1743466244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030680/extras/fe9c82764b161490455b638e76134f75.mp4?t=1743466244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be Who You Want to Be:</strong><br>Customize your appearance with a vast selection of physiques, outfits, and accessories. Find your unique style and express yourself the way you love.<br></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Connect with Diverse Personalities:</strong><br>Get to know your neighbors and the townsfolk. Forge friendships, date anyone you like, chat and discover their interests, and surprise them with their favourite gifts.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030680/extras/d15ba255d412ef713f90b285e3e1c498.avif?t=1743466244\" width=616 height=374 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find Your Better Half:</strong><br>Develop romantic relationships, win over your special someone, and embark on an exciting journey together in Sierra when you're ready.<br></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make Your House a Home:</strong><br>Decorate and redesign your apartment to your liking. Buy new furniture, change the floors and walls. Invite your neighbors over and throw the best party ever.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030680/extras/95896033f87b289405dedf9659bcc80f.poster.avif?t=1743466244\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030680/extras/95896033f87b289405dedf9659bcc80f.webm?t=1743466244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030680/extras/95896033f87b289405dedf9659bcc80f.mp4?t=1743466244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover Mysteries:</strong><br>Strange events are disturbing your neighbors' peace. Investigate and find out what\u2019s happening. Will you face the mysteries alone? Will you seek help? Or will you decide to avoid them? The choice is yours!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030680/extras/dd71ac206cf7e0763604fcb7d3ae4c97.avif?t=1743466244\" width=594 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve decided to start a new life in the charming town of Sierra. With your suitcase and your phone, you embark on this exciting adventure. Be who you want to be, meet unique personalities, explore, and create deep connections with the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030680/extras/2d40c8582a30b00c38e8689d62128699.avif?t=1743466244\" width=616 height=342 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, gather, decorate, socialize, relax, and uncover mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030680/extras/6184db8af8f6cc3b2ca749ac30dbb418.avif?t=1743466244\" width=594 height=69 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge Your Destiny:</strong><br>Explore a world full of wonders and secrets waiting to be discovered. Choose how to earn your living: focus on farming, work at the local bakery, or find another way. Build your life with whomever you choose, at your own pace and on your own terms. The control is in your hands!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030680/extras/fe9c82764b161490455b638e76134f75.poster.avif?t=1743466244\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030680/extras/fe9c82764b161490455b638e76134f75.webm?t=1743466244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030680/extras/fe9c82764b161490455b638e76134f75.mp4?t=1743466244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be Who You Want to Be:</strong><br>Customize your appearance with a vast selection of physiques, outfits, and accessories. Find your unique style and express yourself the way you love.<br></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Connect with Diverse Personalities:</strong><br>Get to know your neighbors and the townsfolk. Forge friendships, date anyone you like, chat and discover their interests, and surprise them with their favourite gifts.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030680/extras/d15ba255d412ef713f90b285e3e1c498.avif?t=1743466244\" width=616 height=374 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find Your Better Half:</strong><br>Develop romantic relationships, win over your special someone, and embark on an exciting journey together in Sierra when you're ready.<br></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make Your House a Home:</strong><br>Decorate and redesign your apartment to your liking. Buy new furniture, change the floors and walls. Invite your neighbors over and throw the best party ever.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030680/extras/95896033f87b289405dedf9659bcc80f.poster.avif?t=1743466244\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030680/extras/95896033f87b289405dedf9659bcc80f.webm?t=1743466244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030680/extras/95896033f87b289405dedf9659bcc80f.mp4?t=1743466244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover Mysteries:</strong><br>Strange events are disturbing your neighbors' peace. Investigate and find out what\u2019s happening. Will you face the mysteries alone? Will you seek help? Or will you decide to avoid them? The choice is yours!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Neighbors is an intriguing life simulation and dating game. Start a new life and shape your destiny in the mysterious town of Sierra. Build meaningful relationships, experience thrilling paranormal events, uncover dark secrets, and transform your home into a haven of safety and peace.",
